{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RHYTHMIC combines the fast-paced VR rhythm-game genre with tactical tower defense. Collect magical particles in tune with epic music and skillfully unleash powerful spells upon invading enemies to defend the people of the realm! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let the Music Infuse You!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.poster.avif?t=1758343602\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.webm?t=1758343602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/cbfbd8a9d6aa5a90f637a02f0538042b.mp4?t=1758343602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music is the source of all power in this realm! Magical particles spawn in tune with the rhythm. Catch as many as you can to power your spells!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fend off Your Foes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.poster.avif?t=1758343602\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.webm?t=1758343602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/2b340d5d78b4b83532a32ab4142cef97.mp4?t=1758343602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will attack relentlessly! Aim well and exploit each enemy's weakness with the right kind of magic to be as effective as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay in Control!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/3b22fec891ed67a696709700b52f93d7.poster.avif?t=1758343602\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/3b22fec891ed67a696709700b52f93d7.webm?t=1758343602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/extras/3b22fec891ed67a696709700b52f93d7.mp4?t=1758343602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Some enemies will fight back. Avoid their attacks or lose your charged mana, take too many hits and you will face an early defeat!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your scenario with the help (or distraction) of the tree companions Drog and Bog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on 5 different maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against 5 different enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 10 different songs on 4 distinct difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements and customizations like hand models, enemy skins and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb separate leaderboards for each song on each difficulty.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3479170?t=1758343602","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/0631a30b195ca55b11d1da86a40027cbdae8467b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758343602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479170/afabd34ac2dab6a7507dfd7c57ee5771b4de37f3/capsule_231